    "output_token_ids_sha256": "d7974af9b1897d145ef8b3af464de695a5e41b6fb1674a9a306fe79f6c9f4181",
    "raw_output": "```rust\npub fn ring_buffer_trace(capacity: usize, values: &[i32]) -> Option<Vec<i32>> {\n    if capacity <= 0 {\n        return None;\n    }\n    if values.iter().any(|&v| v == -1) {\n        return None;\n    }\n\n    let mut ring: Vec<i32> = Vec::with_capacity(capacity);\n    let mut head = 0;\n    let mut tail = 0;\n\n    for &value in values {\n        if ring.is_empty() {\n            ring.push(value);\n        } else {\n            let evicted = ring.remove(tail);\n            if evicted == -1 {\n                return None;\n            }\n            ring.push(evicted);\n        }\n        tail = (tail + 1) % capacity;\n    }\n\n    if ring.is_empty() {\n        return None;\n    }\n\n    let mut result = Vec::with_capacity(capacity);\n    for _ in 0..capacity {\n        result.push(ring[head]);\n        head = (head + 1) % capacity;\n    }\n\n    Some(result)\n}\n```<|im_end|>",
